    <h2>Using AksyRes</h2>
    <p>These terms cover access to the AksyRes website, PWA, Android launcher, and reporting functions. Read the <a href="{{ route('legal.privacy') }}">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="{{ route('legal.license') }}">App License</a> alongside them. New account registration requires affirmative agreement; merely visiting a page is not recorded as acceptance.</p>
